('svaya-robot-ics', 'Svaya Robot:ics', 'startup', 'Offers collaborative robots for industrial automation purposes', 'Svaya Robotics specializes in manufacturing and supplying collaborative robots, designing user-friendly Cobots for the manufacturing sector.The features include a UI/UX that enables workers to teach and interact with the robot, adapting to the context and also augment human ability. These robots are completely software driven and are easy to deploy in any setup. Our cobots are engineered for various industries like automotive, consumer durables, healthcare, food, pharmaceuticals, warehouse logistics etc., and can be used by any SME or large companies for edge-tasks.', 'https://svayarobotics.com/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'Manufacturing', 'Automation Machinery Manufacturing', 'Pre-seed', '2018', 'Vijay R Seelam', '', 'Unfunded', 17.40931, 78.45103, '', 'live'),
