('aikenist', 'Aikenist', 'startup', 'Aikenist provides AI based solutions for faster scanning, better detection and quick turnaround to reach to benefits…', 'AI-based software suite for radiology diagnosis process. The company''s QuickSuite includes QuickFlow online appointment booking and billing, QuickScan to reduce scanning time and QuickRad and QuickDiag AI analysis of X-rays for detection of COVID-19.', 'https://www.aikenist.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Healthtech', 'Healthcare IT', 'Seed', '2019', 'Ashwin Amarapuram', 'Right Side Capital Management BIRAC, C-CAMP, Marl Accelerator', '', 12.93195, 77.63857, '', 'live'),
('hirex-ai', 'Hirex.ai', 'startup', 'hirex.ai is a no-code AI platform to build voice-based bots that conduct and score level one interviews at scale', 'Al-based bots for applicant tracking. Job seekers use the platform to discover jobs and recruiters to post jobs and recruit candidates. It offers tools to reach out to candidates via WhatsApp chatbots or email and also conduct remote interviews using voice-based bots. It also provides tools for candidate screening and resumes parsing. Monetizes through subscription-based pricing plans.', 'https://www.hirex.ai/', 'Hyderabad', 'Telangana', 'HRtech', 'HRTech > Applicant Tracking System', 'Seed', '2019', 'Ugendreshwar Kudupudi, Sayyad Nayyaroddeen', 'SusSEED Innovation, IIIT Hyderabad', '$144K', 17.4481, 78.46002, '', 'live'),
('cropin', 'CropIn', 'startup', 'A leading ''Full-Stack AgTech'' organization providing smart SaaS based solutions to agribusinesses globally, to…', 'Cloud based ERP software and solutions for the agriculture sector and farmers. It leverages AI models to offer location and crop agnostic, ag-knowledge graphs, intelligence at crop, location, and pin code levels, and convergence of satellite imagery and cloud computing. It offers solutions for farming companies, agri-input companies, crop insurance providers, seed production companies, governments, and advisories.', 'https://www.cropin.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'CropTech', 'Series C+', '2010', 'Krishna Kumar, Kunal Prasad', 'Google, Chiratae Ventures, ImpactAssests, BSP Funds, Beenext', '$68.9M', 12.979, 77.59404, '', 'live'),
('zunroof', 'ZunRoof', 'startup', 'Solar panel installation and O&M service providing company', 'Provider of end-to-end solar power alternatives intended to help convert urban rooftops to solar energy power plants. The company''s services include assessing the rooftop through shadow profiling and multiple layouts and offering a remote monitoring system that provides real-time updates, enabling people to have access to solar energy and IoT energy alternatives that make personal energy consumption cleaner and affordable while also taking care of the energy harnessing, storage, maintenance and electricity consumption.', 'https://www.zunroof.com/', 'Gurugram', 'Delhi NCR', 'Cleantech', 'Appliances, Electrical, and Electronics Manufacturing', 'Series A', '2016', 'Pranesh Chaudhary, Sushant Sachan', 'Godrej Industries', '$6.05M', 28.51134, 77.05673, '', 'live'),
('deep-rooted', 'Deep Rooted', 'startup', 'Deep Rooted - Online platform offering farm-based fruits and vegetables', 'Online platform offering farm-based fruits and vegetables . The product catalog includes including spinach, amaranthus, mint, coriander, lettuce, gourds, capsicum, cauliflower, broccoli, bananas, oranges, grapes, papaya, and more. Its mobile application is available on Android and iOS platforms.', 'https://deeprooted.co/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'CropTech, Online Grocery', 'Series A', '2018', 'Arvind Murali, Avinash Ramamurthy', 'Accel, Mayfield, Brand Capital, IvyCap Ventures, Alteria Capital, Omnivore', '$24.5M', 12.95792, 77.61753, '', 'live'),
('esmito', 'Esmito', 'startup', 'Saas & IoT enabled battery management products and solutions for electric vehicles', 'Saas & IoT enabled battery management products and solutions for electric vehicles. It offers hardware and software-enabled solutions for clients. It offers various products like batteries, vehicle control units, and swap stations with features like lightweight, ease of integration with the proprietary battery management system, cloud connection, and more. It offers services like charging solutions, fleet management, battery swapping solutions & more with features like data analytics and reporting, automated payments management, battery health predictions, etc. It offers solutions for logistics, mobility operators, and others.', 'https://www.esmito.com/', 'Chennai', 'Tamil Nadu', 'Cleantech', 'Technology, Information and Internet', 'Seed', '2018', 'Hasan Ali, Co-, Prabhjot Kaur', 'Unicorn India , HPCL', '$1.39M', 13.05175, 80.32362, '', 'live'),
('qzense-labs', 'qZense Labs', 'startup', 'Provider of IoT solutions for food quality assessment and management', 'Provider of internet of things based automation and analytics services intended for optimizing food supply chain operations. The company utilizes handheld scanners and loggers to gather data on ripeness, internal spoilage, sweetness, and shelf life, enabling the food retail industry to predict shelf life and manage inventory more efficiently.', 'http://www.qzense.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Deeptech', 'IT Services and IT Consulting', 'Seed', '2019', 'Rubal Chib, Srishti Batra', 'SOSV, Indian angel network, BlackSoil, Dominor', '$966K', 12.92151, 77.55441, '', 'live'),
