('scribble-data', 'Scribble Data', 'startup', 'Generative AI and machine learning platform to build low-code data products', 'Designed to bridge the gap between data science and data engineering enabling organizations to leverage generative AI to drive business value and accelerate growth.The company''s platform prepares data sets for continuous use by data science teams and their models, enabling data teams to go from raw data to fit-for-purpose datasets that power the decisions that businesses need to make every day.', 'https://www.scribbledata.io/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Edtech', 'Business/Productivity Software', 'Seed', '2017', 'Venkata Pingali, Indrayudh Ghoshal', 'Blume Ventures, Peak XV Partners, Angel list', '$2.3M.', 13.01421, 77.58757, '', 'live'),
