('creduce', 'Creduce', 'startup', 'Provider of carbon offsetting and IREC trade solutions', 'Creduce is a leading global enterprise in sustainability and carbon credits. Producer of carbon credits intended for climate change mitigation and carbon markets. The company''s project helps business owners and navigators to get their carbon offset projects registered/verified under various GHG programs and trade their carbon credits, enabling businesses to protect the climate change and release of carbon in the environment. It provides tools and expertise to reach carbon neutrality or net zero emissions.', 'https://creduce.tech/', 'Ahmedabad', 'Gujarat', 'Healthtech', 'Environmental Services', 'Series A', '2021', 'Shailendra Rao, Vishwaraj Rao', '', '$20M.', 23.02714, 72.5814, '', 'live'),
('strideahead', 'StrideAhead', 'startup', 'Automating talent data for catalyzing education and the human resource ecosystem for faster, smarter and quicker,…', 'Cloud-based suite solutions for workforce analytics. It offers features like automating talent data, boosting enrollments, streamlining operations, reducing customer acquisition cost (CAC), and improving engagement through career mapping and gap analysis. Platform integrates with existing systems and provides insights into soft skills. It uses AI technology for behavioural analytics.', 'https://www.strideahead.io/', 'Delhi', 'Delhi NCR', 'Edtech', 'HRTech > Workforce Analytics', 'Seed', '2019', 'Piyush Gupta', 'Bonbillo, Rachit Poddar, IVY Growth Associates, UIncept Accelerator', '$121K', 28.62011, 77.23388, '', 'live'),
('vegrow', 'VeGrow', 'startup', 'Online B2B marketplace offering fruits and vegetables from farms', 'Operator of a farming support platform designed to simplify agricultural activities using technology.The company maximises farmers’ income, by accurately grading produce and efficiently matching it with the most suitable demand channel. This creates a virtuous cycle, attracting more farmers through competitive pricing as well as more buyers, who seek consistency in both price and quality. The company''s platform partners with farmers and provides services like personalized advisory for yield and grade mix, supply chain facilities and access to farm produce marketplace, enabling farmers to operate their functionalities efficiently.', 'https://www.vegrow.in/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Agritech', 'Farming', 'Series C+', '2020', 'Praneeth Kumar, Kiran Naik Bhukya, Mrudhukar Batchu', 'GIC, Elevation Capital, Light speed, matrix partners india', '$85.7M.', 12.95347, 77.61828, '', 'live'),
('dubverse', 'Dubverse', 'startup', 'AI-based platform generating multilingual videos', 'AI-based platform generating multilingual videos. The company provides solutions like subtitling, voice substitution, and video recreation. The solution allows users to use voices in various languages and voices, lip-sync videos, and subtitle videos.', 'https://dubverse.ai/', 'Noida', 'Delhi NCR', 'AI', 'Online Audio and Video Media', 'Seed', '2021', 'Varshul Gupta', 'VSP, Kalaari Capital', '$800K', 28.56525, 77.41548, '', 'live'),
