('vphrase', 'vPhrase', 'startup', 'AI based Data Anaytics platform', 'AI based report generation tool. It summarises data into a few bullet points, highlighting key insights required for decision making. It assists enterprises to develop automated reports and accessing insights. It uses Natural Language Generation tool to explain the key insights in words.', 'https://www.vphrase.com/', 'Mumbai', 'Maharashtra', 'AI', 'Business Intelligence > Data Discovery and Visualization > Reporting and Dashboarding >…', 'Series A', '2015', 'Neerav Parekh', 'Microsoft Accelerator, T-Hub, Bharat Innovation Fund, Alpha Wave Global', '$2.14M', 19.09204, 72.84438, '', 'live'),
