('blackbuck', 'BlackBuck', 'startup', 'AI based freight marketplace to book trucks for transportation', 'AI based freight marketplace to book trucks for transportation. It provides a web-based platforms that allows fleet operators to post loads and find carriers, make bookings, track and manage shipments using GPS. It connects shippers with fleet operators to locate the trucks, and ship the goods. Features include online payments, transactions history, loading, and unloading details, checking order status, and resolving disputes.', 'http://www.blackbuck.com/', 'Bengaluru', 'Karnataka', 'Logistics', 'Logistics Tech > AI', 'Series C+', '2015', 'Rajesh Yabaji, Chanakya Hridaya, Ramasubramanian B', 'Accel, Trifecta Capital, Flipkart', '$359M', 12.92238, 77.62339, '', 'live'),
